4. Open Typography & Typefaces
==============================================================================
License: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org), except KFGQPC
Typefaces (each renders the complete Uthmani text, including pause marks and open tanween):
  • KFGQPC Uthmanic Script Hafs (Madinah Mushaf style) - King Fahd Glorious Qur'an Printing
    Complex, distributed under the KFGQPC end-user licence
  • Amiri (classic Naskh) - The Amiri Project Authors (SIL OFL 1.1)
  • Scheherazade New (traditional Naskh) - SIL Global (SIL OFL 1.1)
  • Noto Naskh Arabic (modern Naskh) - The Noto Project Authors (SIL OFL 1.1)
  • Lateef (South Asian Naskh) - SIL Global (SIL OFL 1.1)
  • Noore Huda (Noorani Qur'an, Indo-Pak) and Noore Hira (Hafezi Qur'an, Indo-Pak 15-line) -
    NooreHidayat, www.noorehidayat.org; free to distribute with any application per the
    NooreHidayat end-user licence. Shown with five marks in their Indo-Pak form (ٱ→ا, ۡ→ْ,
    ٞ ٖ ٗ → ٌ ٍ ً).

  The web app and the word/root pages self-host Scheherazade New and Amiri Quran (css/fonts, with
  their OFL texts).

